1
00:00:00,462 --> 00:00:01,692
(Leonard:)Oh, we have to use the stairs.

2
00:00:01,697 --> 00:00:03,497
(Alfred Hofstadter:)When are they gonna fix
your elevator?

3
00:00:03,498 --> 00:00:05,328
(Leonard:)Uh... I don't... any day now.

4
00:00:05,333 --> 00:00:09,103
(Alfred:)Well, the stairs are fine.

5
00:00:09,104 --> 00:00:12,504
(Alfred:)Besides, your
mother is up there.

6
00:00:12,507 --> 00:00:15,337
(Alfred:)Maybe I'll have a heart attack
and not have to see her.

7
00:00:18,013 --> 00:00:20,313
(Leonard:)Hey, I, I know things
are a little rough

8
00:00:20,315 --> 00:00:21,685
(Leonard:)with you and Mom,

9
00:00:21,683 --> 00:00:23,783
(Leonard:)but I'm really
glad you're here.

10
00:00:23,785 --> 00:00:25,555
(Alfred:)Me, too.
(chuckles)

11
00:00:28,390 --> 00:00:32,190
(Alfred:)I should have never had that
angioplasty because I feel fine.

12
00:00:35,464 --> 00:00:37,494
(Leonard:)Penny's really looking
forward to seeing you.

13
00:00:37,499 --> 00:00:39,329
(Alfred:)Ah, she's a sweetie.

14
00:00:39,334 --> 00:00:41,734
(Alfred:)You got a good one there,
Leonard.

15
00:00:41,737 --> 00:00:44,437
(Leonard:)Thanks, Dad.

16
00:00:44,439 --> 00:00:47,539
(Alfred:)How the hell did you do that?

17
00:00:48,744 --> 00:01:04,024
(celery crunches loudly)

